      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I initially wrote that comment on the server, but I'll also put it here :\n\n```\n\nIt's a great system,  but honestly, I don't think it's a good idea to add LV support, since it is a system that is still evolving. For instance, version 2 added point light volume support, which is incompatible with shaders that still uses version 1. If one day version 3+ gets released, all shaders might need to be updated again to support all the newly added features.\n\nI believe those assets should have really simple shaders, and maybe have two variants like Standard/PBR and Toon shaded, that's it.\n\n```",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
